Package: qore-zip-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-zip-module-doc
Description: ZIP archives and data providers for Qore
 This package provides native ZIP bindings, the ZipDataProvider source and
 compiled module, qzip, compiler metadata, provider resources and translations.
 It supports ZIP64, streams, deflate, BZip2, LZMA, XZ and Zstandard compression,
 and traditional PKWARE or AES encryption.

Package: qore-zip-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-zip-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's ZIP modules
 This package contains HTML API references and test examples for the zip
 native module and ZipDataProvider.
